      "jobId": "308e271e-543f-4894-a548-5c17bb48bca4",
      "question": "In the scanned loan modification request, which loan is the borrower asking to modify, and what payment relief are they requesting?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-03T04:21:17.348719Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-03T04:21:27.516834Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "Based on the scanned loan modification request (Form LS-114), the borrower **Marisol H. Lindqvist** (Customer ID **C00828**) is asking to modify their **personal loan (unsecured), Loan Number L00168**, with an original principal of **$11,500.00** and current monthly payment of **$425.10** [1].\n\nThe payment relief requested includes:\n\n1. **Temporary payment reduction** to **$255 per month for 6 months**, beginning **10/01/2026** [1]\n2. **Term extension** of up to **12 months** [1]\n3. **Waiver of late fees** assessed in the last **60 days** [1]\n\nThe borrower cites a reduction in work hours (from 40 to 22 per week) and a ~40% drop in take-home pay starting in July 2026 as the hardship reason, and has attached a work schedule letter as documentation [1]. The form was signed and dated **09/14/2026** and received by Loan Servicing on **09/16/2026** (Case HM-2026-0412) [1].\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Unstructured Retrieval evidence — 2 documents — evidence `hermes-receipt:e25312d64ec9cbd5dc73036c420e23be3cbebaabd5b6eb365a365ed4836465df`",
